Then GitLab, where tons of companies keep their code and the automated pipelines that push updates live.

27
00:02:55,438 --> 00:03:03,920
它在 10 月 12 日和 21 日分别出现了两个满分 10 分的漏洞，
允许任何人无需登录即可接管自托管的 GitLab 服务器。
It got two perfect 10 out of 10 bugs on October 12th and 21st, letting
anyone take over a self-hosted GitLab server without logging in.

28
00:03:04,078 --> 00:03:09,220
10 月 20 日，Chrome 156 发布了 353 项安全修复。
On October 20th, Chrome 156 shipped with 353 security fixes.

29
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:14,980
一年前，Chrome 141 和 142 分别包含 21 个和 26 个漏洞。
A year ago, Chrome 141 and 142 had 21 and 26.

30
00:03:15,630 --> 00:03:21,604
其中六个是严重漏洞，包括一个评分为 9.6 的漏洞，它能让带有陷阱的网页逃离 Chrome 的沙箱。
Six were critical, including a 9.6 where a booby-trapped web page could escape Chrome's sandbox.

31
00:03:22,286 --> 00:03:32,260
这六个中的四个来自 Anthropic 研究员 Xin Young Jay，其中一个是在 Claude 的帮助下发现的，
还有一个来自 OpenAI 的 Codex Security，所以六个里有五个是来自 AI 公司的。
Four of those six came from anthropic researcher Xin Young Jay, one found with Claude's help,
and one more from OpenAI's Codex Security, so five of six came from AI companies.

32
00:03:32,558 --> 00:03:34,692
接着到了 10 月 21 日那个晚上。
Then came the night of October 21st.

33
