法国要求所有省政府网站下线，德国、比利时、维基媒体和任天堂也停止了相关服务。
France ordered every provincial government site offline, and Germany, Belgium, Wikimedia, and Nintendo pulled services too.

38
00:04:02,542 --> 00:04:12,516
在日本，Pixiv 和 NicoNico 进入紧急维护，寿司连锁店 Sushiro 暂停了订餐应用，
而中国《最终幻想14》的玩家不得不更换启动器。
In Japan, Pixiv and Nikonico went into emergency maintenance, the Sushi Chain Sushiro paused its ordering app,
and Final Fantasy XIV players in China had to switch launchers.

39
00:04:13,038 --> 00:04:15,904
在有人闯入之前，他们全部拔掉了电源。
All of them unplugged themselves before anyone broke in.

40
00:04:16,110 --> 00:04:19,904
原因是 PHP，这是运行互联网后台的语言。
The reason is PHP, the language running the back kitchen of the internet.

41
00:04:20,384 --> 00:04:25,540
无论是在网站上登录、搜索还是评论，通常都是由 PHP 处理的。
Login, search, or comment on a site, and PHP is usually what's handling it.

42
00:04:25,904 --> 00:04:38,070
WordPress、Drupal、Joomla、Magento 以及支撑维基百科的软件都运行在它上面。W3Tech 表示，
在有明确后端的网站中，PHP 驱动了 69.3% 的站点，涵
WordPress, Drupal, Joomla, Magento, and the software behind Wikipedia all run on it,
and W3Tech says it powers 69.3% of websites with an identifiable backend, over 33 million sites, while Second Place sits at 8.1%.

43
00:04:38,070 --> 00:04:42,384
盖超过 3300 万个网站，而排名第二的比例仅为 8.1%。
WordPress, Drupal, Joomla, Magento, and the software behind Wikipedia all run on it,
and W3Tech says it powers 69.3% of websites with an identifiable backend, over 33 million sites, while Second Place sits at 8.1%.

44
00:04:43,150 --> 00:04:52,836
这两个被称为 PHP Shell 的漏洞可以让攻击者通过一次请求获取到 Shell，
也就是你服务器上的命令行，从而获得完全控制权，且不需要密码。
The two bugs, nicknamed PHP2 Shell, let one request get an attacker a shell,
a command line on your server, so total control, no password needed.

45
00:04:53,294 --> 00:04:57,252
两个漏洞都被评为 9.2 分，而 Watchtower 给出了满分 10 分。
Both are rated 9.2, and Watchtower gave them a full 10.

46
00:04:57,454 --> 00:04:59,684
第一个是关于内存耗尽的问题。
The first one is about running out of memory.

47
00:05:00,110 --> 00:05:08,230
PHP 会触发紧急停止，而在恰好错误的时刻导致数据只设置了一半，
而清理程序会将其视为真实状态，因此在 Apache
PHP slams an emergency stop, and at exactly the wrong moment that leaves data half set up, which the cleanup treats as real,
so on Apache, an attacker can run code before the website's own code even starts.

48
00:05:08,230 --> 00:05:11,940
上，攻击者可以在网站自身的代码启动前运行代码。
PHP slams an emergency stop, and at exactly the wrong moment that leaves data half set up, which the cleanup treats as real,
so on Apache, an attacker can run code before the website's own code even starts.

49
00:05:12,590 --> 00:05:22,372
第二个是关于残留问题，即下一个请求重用了 PHP 已经丢弃的内存，
这可能导致代码执行或泄露其他用户的密码和 API 密钥。
The second is about leftovers, where the next request reuses memory PHP already threw away,
which can run code or leak other users' passwords and API keys.

50
00:05:22,958 --> 00:05:25,744
Wiz 表示，即使是最简单的 Hello World 网站也会受到影响。
Wiz said, even a bare Hello World site is affected.

51
