That night, Caliph, one of the finders, accidentally posted a demo of its attack hitting real targets, and next morning ChainGuard,
a distributor with early access, broke its non-disclosure agreement and shipped the fix early,

55
00:06:09,370 --> 00:06:09,420
那天晚上，发现者之一 Caliph 不小心发布了一个攻击真实目标的演示，第二天早上，
拥有早期访问权限的分销商 ChainGuard 违反了保密协议并提前发布了修复补丁，
