but nobody could prove it was exploitable, and every fix broke something, so it stalled.

64
00:06:56,462 --> 00:06:59,424
作家 Nick Rogers 将这种安全状况称为“通过疲劳实现的安全性”。
Writer Nick Rogers calls this security by exhaustion.

65
