将此类漏洞转化为可行的攻击需要数周枯燥的手动调试，所以没人去弄，
因此大量陈旧的互联网代码就这样被保护了起来。
Turning a bug like this into a working attack took weeks of tedious manual debugging, so nobody bothered,
and tons of old internet code is protected that way.

66
00:07:07,566 --> 00:07:12,384
然后在 6 月，OpenAI 的 Patch the planet 开始资助对开源软件的审计。
Then in June, OpenAI's Patch the planet, started funding audits of open source software.

67
