但你安装的内容却是被感染的，而且它通常包含你的 API 密钥。
Light LLM, which connects apps to AI models and gets 23 million downloads a week,
had version 1.107.0 poisoned through stolen publishing credentials, so the GitHub code looked clean while what you installed was

