Anthropic's September report adds Russia-linked AI agents rewriting malware whenever it got flagged,
a Chinese-speaking group whose agents produced over a dozen suspected zero days in a month,

107
00:11:43,420 --> 00:11:48,036
还有一名孤立的黑客利用 AI 编写的 WordPress 漏洞入侵了 42 个目标中的 14 个。
and a lone hacker whose AI-written WordPress exploit got into 14 of 42 targets.

108
00:11:48,622 --> 00:12:01,828
CrowdStrike 表示，2025 年由 AI 驱动的攻击活动增加了 89%，
从入侵到在网络内部扩散的平均时间缩短到 29 分钟，最快仅需 27 秒。
