got into live systems at Indian companies, reading confidential records unnoticed.

113
00:12:29,518 --> 00:12:34,368
在防御方面，Anthropic 的 Frontier 红队和 Theorem Labs 刚刚发布了一项重大成果。
On defense, Anthropic's Frontier Red Team and Theorem Labs just dropped something huge.

114
00:12:34,830 --> 00:12:44,228
Google 的 OSS fuzz 已花费十年时间对 1MB 以下的程序进行随机输入测试，
进行了数万亿次测试，但任何它漏掉的路径都可能让漏洞永远隐藏。
Google's OSS fuzz has spent a decade throwing random inputs under one megabyte at programs, trillions of tests,
but any path it misses can hide a bug forever.

115
00:12:44,654 --> 00:12:54,532
在这里，Claude 必须在数学上证明，任何低于 64MB 的输入都不会在任何可能的路径上触发特定
的崩溃，甚至细化到芯片运行的原始指令。
Here, Claude had to mathematically prove no input under 64 megabytes could trigger
certain crashes on any possible path, down to the raw instructions the chip runs.

116
00:12:55,150 --> 00:13:00,608
当证明卡住时，要么是缺少证明，要么就是真实的漏洞，这时 Claude 会进行修复并继续前进。
When a proof got stuck, it was either a missing proof or a real bug, so Claude patched it and kept going.

117
00:13:00,846 --> 00:13:16,048
在几周内，它验证了 123 个项目中 239 个入口点，在约 10 亿行生成的代码中，
