准确到足以启动 Ubuntu 系统，并从官方的 x86 手册中发现了数百个错误，
Claude even wrote its own model of x86, the instruction language of Intel and AMD chips, accurate enough to boot Ubuntu,
and found hundreds of errors in the official X86 manual, plus a few bugs in the CPUs themselves.

123
00:13:53,550 --> 00:13:56,260
还在 CPU 本身中发现了一些 Bug。
Claude even wrote its own model of x86, the instruction language of Intel and AMD chips, accurate enough to boot Ubuntu,
