OpenAI 在一个价值百万美元的问题上抢先夺走了他的成果。
One of them takes the biggest swing in 160 years at the Riemann hypothesis, probably the most famous unsolved problem in math.
Now mathematicians are comparing AI companies to the mafia, and one

138
00:15:37,830 --> 00:15:42,276
OpenAI 在一个价值百万美元的问题上抢先夺走了他的成果。
professor says OpenAI raced to scoop his work on a million-dollar problem.

139
00:15:42,766 --> 00:15:53,636
这些内容都在 10 月 6 日上传到了名为 OpenAI/math 的公共仓库。
这 722 篇论文被分为 372 个系列，每一个都是一个重大结果及其衍生研究。
It all went up on October 6th in a public repository called OpenAI slash math. The
722 papers are grouped into 372 families, each one a big result plus its spin-offs.

140
00:15:54,190 --> 00:16:02,788
在这些系列中，有 235 个包含 Lean 语言的证明，这是一种让计
算机可以核实每一步的编程语言，这样你就不用盲目信任 AI 了。
