After hearing from over 600 mathematicians, the group's September 29th guidelines
opened by asking labs to stop testing big math problems on private models entirely.

192
00:22:33,358 --> 00:22:35,300
其余内容归结为展示你的工作过程。
The rest boils down to showing your work.

193
00:22:35,726 --> 00:22:45,604
包括使用哪个模型、哪些提示词、推理逻辑、耗时、成本，以及经过计算机核查的证明、
存储空间、不被 AI 公司控制，且不包含营销信息。
Which model, what prompts, how it reasoned, how long it took and what it cost,
computer-checked proofs, storage, no AI company controls, and no marketing.

194
00:22:46,030 --> 00:22:58,944
大批量数据应解释如何选择问题以及有多少个失败了，且实验室应资助会议、夏令营和研讨会，
由非营利组织决定资金去向，并让数学家能够使用公共模型。
Big batches should explain how the problems were picked and how many failed, and labs should fund conferences, summer schools,
