1093
02:00:15,438 --> 02:00:25,316
Google 的量子计算研究人员利用它来优化子程序，
这些是限制重要应用性能的量子算法中的小型构建块。
Google's quantum computing researchers use it to optimize subroutines, which are smaller
building blocks inside quantum algorithms that bottleneck important applications.

1094
02:00:25,966 --> 02:00:36,676
目标是减少 Google 所说的时空资源，也就是量子比特数量乘以门的数量，
即所需的硬件量乘以运行的操作次数。
The goal is to cut what Google calls space-time resources, basically the number of qubits multiplied by the number of gates,
so how much quantum hardware you need times how many operations you run.

1095
02:00:37,230 --> 02:00:41,668
在其中一个案例中，Argon 在短短几分钟内就比已发布的基准线提高了 40%。
In one case, Argon beat the published baseline by 40% in a matter of minutes.

1096
02:00:41,998 --> 02:00:45,956
也就是说，Argon 改进了人类研究人员已经发布的工作成果。
So this is Argonne improving on work human researchers had already put out.

1097
02:00:46,414 --> 02:00:47,264
接下来是内存问题。
Then there's memory.

1098
02:00:47,534 --> 02:00:57,890
一组 Argon 智能体分析了 Google 全线数据中心的性能分析遥测，
即显示服务器如何使用工作内存的所有性能数据，并自主识别出内存优化方案并将其应用。
A team of Argon agents went through profiling telemetry from Google's entire data center fleet,
which is all the performance data showing how servers use their working memory,

1099
02:00:57,890 --> 02:01:02,308
一组 Argon 智能体分析了 Google 全线数据中心的性能分析遥测，
即显示服务器如何使用工作内存的所有性能数据，并自主识别出内存优化方案并将其应用。
and they autonomously identified memory optimizations and applied them.

1100
02:01:02,830 --> 02:01:07,236
一旦部署，就能释放超过 300 TBytes 的内存。
Once rolled out, that frees up more than 300 TBytes of memory.

1101
02:01:07,726 --> 02:01:12,132
一个 tebibyte 比一 terabyte 多一点，所以我们说的是超过 300 terabytes。
A tebibyte is a little more than a terabyte, so we're talking over 300 terabytes.

1102
02:01:12,686 --> 02:01:19,620
Google 估计总共节省了 500 TBytes 到整整一个 pebibyte，大约是 1000 TBytes。
And Google estimates total savings between 500 TBytes and a full pebibyte, which is about a thousand TBytes.

1103
02:01:20,046 --> 02:01:24,356
仅通过软件更改就释放了大量的服务器容量。
That's a huge chunk of server capacity freed up by software changes alone.

1104
02:01:24,878 --> 02:01:29,988
Argon 智能还在跨 Google 将 C 和 C++ 代码迁移到 Rust。
Argon agents are also migrating code from C and C to Rust across Google.

1105
02:01:30,446 --> 02:01:37,092
Rust 是一种旨在防止一类内存错误的编程语言，而这些恰好是黑客最喜欢利用的漏洞。
Rust is a programming language designed to prevent a whole category of memory bugs,
which happen to be the kind hackers love to exploit.

1106
02:01:37,550 --> 02:01:50,120
涉及的项目范围从 Re 2、Google 的文本匹配库和 LibGov1 等核心库的数万行代码，
一直到 Fuchsia Zircon 内核，它是 Google Fuchsia 操作系统的核心，拥有超过 80 万行代码。
The projects range from tens of thousands of lines in core libraries like Re 2, Google's Text Matching Library, and LibGov1,
all the way up to the Fuchsia Zircon kernel, which is the core of

1107
02:01:50,120 --> 02:01:55,204
涉及的项目范围从 Re 2、Google 的文本匹配库和 LibGov1 等核心库的数万行代码，
一直到 Fuchsia Zircon 内核，它是 Google Fuchsia 操作系统的核心，拥有超过 80 万行代码。
Google's Fuchsia operating system and has more than 800,000 lines of code.

1108
02:01:55,662 --> 02:02:05,476
由于这些系统大多至关重要，在任何内容进入生产环境之前，
重写代码都要经过严格的自动和手动审计、模拟、测试和审查。
Because so many of these systems are critical, the rewrites go through rigorous, automated, and manual auditing, emulation, testing,
and review before anything goes into production.

1109
02:02:05,966 --> 02:02:08,304
LibGrav1 的工作是最令人印象深刻的例子。
The LibGav1 work is the most impressive example.

1110
02:02:08,654 --> 02:02:14,564
LibGrav1 是 Google 用于解码视频的开源软件，并且已经有了 Rust 移植版本。
LibGav1 is Google's open source software for decoding video, and there was already a Rust port of it.

1111
02:02:15,054 --> 02:02:25,412
Argon 智能体对该移植版进行了处理，并替换了 32,000 行 SIMD 代码，
这是为了追求速度而手动调优的底层代码，能让处理器同时处理多个数据片段。
Argon agents took that port and replaced 32,000 lines of SIMD code, which is hand tuned,
low level code that makes the processor crunch several pieces of data at once for speed.

1112
02:02:25,934 --> 02:02:35,780
他们进行了多轮基于性能分析的实验，测量耗时分布，不断调整并再次测量，
并且研究了编译器实际生成的产物。
They ran round after round of profile guided experiments, measuring where the time goes, tweaking, measuring again,
and they studied what the compiler was actually producing.

1113
02:02:36,270 --> 02:02:43,300
然后他们编写了简洁、安全的 Rust 代码，其结构能让
编译器自动执行那些加速技巧，也就是所谓的向量化。
Then they wrote plain, safe Rust, structured so the compiler would do those speed tricks automatically, which is called vectorization.

1114
02:02:43,758 --> 02:02:56,516
最终结果是一个内存安全的视频解码器，运行速度比 Rust 版本快 2.7 倍，输出内容一致，
且更接近优化后的 C 原版速度。
The end result is a memory-safe video decoder that runs 2.7 times faster than the Rust port, gives identical video output,
and gets closer to the speed of the optimized C original.

1115
02:02:56,750 --> 02:03:03,844
为了处理如此长的工作量，Google 将 Argon 的输出限制提高到 100 万 Token，之前是 64,000。
To handle work this long, Google raised Argon's output limit to 1 million tokens, up from 64,000 before.

1116
02:03:04,078 --> 02:03:08,068
这大约是原来的 15 倍，Google 称这是行业领先的水平。
That's around 15 times more, and Google calls it industry leading.

1117
02:03:08,558 --> 02:03:18,724
其核心理念是，当模型有足够的空间在单次运行中思考并生成数十万个 Token 时，
它就能以全新的深度进行推理，并一次性解决难题。
The idea is that when the model has room to think and generate hundreds of thousands of tokens in a single run,
it can reason at a whole new depth and solve tough problems in one go.

1118
02:03:19,214 --> 02:03:22,404
至少在理论上，这些基准测试支持了其在编程方面的声明。
The benchmarks back up the coding claims, at least on paper.

1119
02:03:22,798 --> 02:03:32,448
在测试长程任务和真实世界软件工程任务的 DeepSwee V 1.1 上，
Argon 以 77.9% 的成绩创下了新的最先进水平。
On DeepSwee V 1.1, which tests long horizon, real-world software engineering tasks, Argon sets a new state-of-the-art at 77.9%.

1120
02:03:33,230 --> 02:03:36,580
在编程之外，它是 VALS 指数中的顶尖模型。
Outside of coding, it's the top model on the VALS index.

1121
02:03:37,326 --> 02:03:50,980
VALS 是一家近期非常流行的基准测试初创公司，其指数衡量金融、编程、
法律和税务工作的经济影响，每个领域的权重取决于其对美国 GDP 的贡献程度。
VALS is a benchmarking startup that's become pretty popular lately, and its index measures economic impact across finance, coding,
legal, and tax work, with each sector weighted by how much it contributes to US GDP.

1122
02:03:51,470 --> 02:04:02,020
Argon 在涉及多步金融研究的 Vals Finance Agent V2 以及涵盖法律研究与起草的 Harvey's
Legal Agent Benchmark 中也处于领先地位。
Argon also leads on Vals Finance Agent V2, which is multi-step financial research,
and on Harvey's Legal Agent Benchmark, which covers legal research and drafting.

1123
02:04:02,542 --> 02:04:11,008
在衡量端到端执行核心业务功能的 Zapier 基准测试 Automation Bench 上，
Argon 以 51.3% 的成绩排名第一。
On Automation Bench, Zapier's benchmark for running core business functions end-to-end, Argon ranks number one with 51.3%.

1124
02:04:11,854 --> 02:04:17,988
目前最强的模型仅能完成约一半的任务，这说明了真实的业务自动化依然非常困难。
The best model out there, finishing about half of those tasks, tells you how hard real business automation still is.

1125
02:04:18,606 --> 02:04:27,524
它在视觉任务上也表现强劲，例如专业图表分析、从
长视频中提取细节，以及根据一系列文档采取行动。
It's strong at visual work too, like professional chart analysis, picking out details from long videos,
and taking action based on a whole series of documents.

1126
02:04:28,110 --> 02:04:34,608
在衡量长视频理解的 LV Bench 上，它的得分是 91.7%，达到了最先进水平。
On LV Bench, which measures long video understanding, it's state-of-the-art at 91.7%.

1127
02:04:35,438 --> 02:04:48,740
Google 还将创意写作列为其前沿领域的优势之一，并声称在多项基准测试中，
Argon 的得分明显高于 GPT-6 Astra 以及 Anthropic 的 Fable 和 Opus 模型。
Google also lists creative writing as one of its frontier level strengths, and overall it claims Argon scores significantly higher
than GPT-6 Astra and also Anthropics Fable and Opus models across a bunch of benchmarks.

1128
02:04:49,518 --> 02:05:02,490
Google Deepmind 的 Gemini 产品负责人 Tulsi Doshi 告诉 Axios，Argon 是一个全能模型，
在多个领域都具备前沿能力，且 Google 员工已经对其进行了数周的压力测试，
Tulsi Doshi, head of Gemini Products at Google Deepmind, told Axios that Argon is a well-rounded model that has frontier capabilities
across several domains, and that Googlers have been putting it through its paces for weeks,

1129
02:05:02,490 --> 02:05:02,550
Google Deepmind 的 Gemini 产品负责人 Tulsi Doshi 告诉 Axios，Argon 是一个全能模型，
在多个领域都具备前沿能力，且 Google 员工已经对其进行了数周的压力测试，
with many relying on it for their hardest coding and research problems.

1130
02:05:02,550 --> 02:05:06,596
许多人正依靠它来解决最困难的编程和研究问题。
with many relying on it for their hardest coding and research problems.

1131
02:05:07,182 --> 02:05:15,808
但 Bloomberg 在同日引用匿名消息源报道称，一些员工在内部测试中发现该模型的表现并不理想。
But Bloomberg reported the same day, citing anonymous sources, that some of those
employees actually found the model's performance lacking in internal testing.

1132
02:05:16,078 --> 02:05:18,084
Google 告诉 Bloomberg，这一说法是不准确的。
Google told Bloomberg that was inaccurate.

1133
02:05:18,638 --> 02:05:26,180
尽管如此，模型可以被训练成在基准测试中得分很高，真
正的考验是当开发者开始交给它处理实际工作时的情况。
Still, models can be trained to score well on benchmarks, and the real
test is what happens when developers start throwing actual work at it.

1134
02:05:26,702 --> 02:05:33,156
Google 在公告中还花了大篇幅讲安全性，并在广泛发布前加强了四个领域。
Google also spent a big part of the announcement on safety, with four areas it's strengthening before a broad release.

1135
02:05:33,568 --> 02:05:34,820
第一个是滥用。
The first is misuse.

1136
02:05:35,406 --> 02:05:50,692
Argon 被设计为拒绝可能协助网络攻击或化学、生物、放射性及核武器攻击的请求，
同时仍允许遵循 Google 前沿安全框架的合法双用途科学研究。
Argon is designed to refuse requests that could help with cyber attacks or chemical, biological, radiological, and nuclear attacks,
while still allowing legitimate dual-use scientific research following Google's frontier safety framework.

1137
02:05:51,150 --> 02:06:00,644
Google 还在改进监控模型内部激活的技术，基本上
就是通过观察神经网络内部的活动来发现滥用行为。
Google is also improving its techniques for monitoring the model's internal activations,
so basically watching what's happening inside the neural network to spot misuse.

1138
02:06:01,198 --> 02:06:06,596
随后，内部和外部红队通过手动和自动攻击对这些防护措施进行了压力测试。
Internal and external red teams then stress tested those safeguards with both manual and automated attacks.

1139
02:06:07,088 --> 02:06:15,044
第二个是提示词注入，即网页、文档或其他上下文中的隐藏指令试图劫持模型的行为。
The second is prompt injection, where hidden instructions inside a web page, a document,
or some other context try to hijack what the model does.

1140
02:06:15,662 --> 02:06:26,468
Google 称 Argon 是目前最能抵御此类攻击的模型，这归功于自动红队测试和对抗性训练，
它在 Gray Swan 的间接提示词注入基准测试中也处于领先地位。
Google calls Argon its most resilient model yet against these attacks, thanks to automated red teaming and adversarial training,
and it's leading on Gray Swan's indirect prompt injection benchmark.

1141
02:06:26,688 --> 02:06:33,476
第三个是对齐偏差，即模型为了完成任务而超出了用户真正要求的范围。
The third is misalignment, meaning the model going beyond what the user actually wanted just to get a task done.

1142
02:06:33,934 --> 02:06:42,788
Google 正在部署监控系统来观察 Argon 的思维链，即
它在采取行动时的逐步推理过程，并在需要时停止执行。
Google is deploying monitors that watch Argon's chain of thought, its step-by-step
reasoning along with its actions, and they can stop execution when needed.

1143
02:06:43,406 --> 02:06:53,330
Google 在训练期间运行了类似的系统，并向专门的事件响应团队发送警报；他们非常小心，
不会将这些发现反馈到训练中，因为这可能会教会 Argon 去伪装推理过程以绕过监控。
Google ran a similar system during training, sending alerts to a dedicated incident response team,
and it was careful not to feed those findings back into training because

1144
02:06:53,330 --> 02:06:57,476
Google 在训练期间运行了类似的系统，并向专门的事件响应团队发送警报；他们非常小心，
不会将这些发现反馈到训练中，因为这可能会教会 Argon 去伪装推理过程以绕过监控。
that could teach Argon to shape its reasoning to slip past the monitors.

1145
02:06:58,126 --> 02:07:07,236
Google 还公开呼吁整个行业现在就维护推理透明度，
这样模型的思考过程就能继续用于识别对齐偏差。
Google is also openly urging the rest of the industry to preserve reasoning transparency right now,
so model thoughts stay useful for spotting misalignment.

1146
02:07:07,694 --> 02:07:10,948
第四点是强化用于测试和训练模型的环境。
The fourth is hardening the environments used to test and train the model.

1147
02:07:11,342 --> 02:07:18,788
按照其智能体控制路线图，Google 在任何高风险训练或评估开始前，都会对沙箱进行隔离和封锁。
Following its agent control roadmap, Google is isolating and sealing its sandboxes before any high-risk training or evaluation starts.

1148
02:07:19,150 --> 02:07:22,180
而且它表示将与合作伙伴分享这些智能体安全实践。
And it says it'll share these agent security practices with partners.

1149
02:07:22,862 --> 02:07:25,156
这一切都发生在非常紧张的时刻。
All of this lands at a tense moment.

1150
02:07:25,582 --> 02:07:33,220
顶尖 AI 实验室在竞相发布更强大的模型，而这些公司同时也在警告说 AI 可能会失控。
Top AI labs keep racing to release more powerful models while those same companies warn that AI could spin out of control.

1151
02:07:33,582 --> 02:07:50,500
OpenAI 一直面临智能体失控的问题，最近还表示因为安全问题放弃了 GPT 6.1 Astra，
而且 Axios 报道称 OpenAI 和 Anthropic 正在调查数万起智能体行为异常的事件。
OpenAI has had problems with agents going rogue and recently said it's scrapping GPT 6.1 Astra because of security issues,
and Axios has reported that OpenAI and Anthropic are investigating tens of thousands of incidents of their agents misbehaving.

1152
02:07:50,926 --> 02:07:56,612
在这种背景下，Google 多花点时间看起来并不像几个月前那样糟糕了。
Against that backdrop, Google taking extra time doesn't look nearly as bad as it did a few months ago.

1153
02:07:57,038 --> 02:07:59,428
而且 Google 的起跑位置也不算弱。
And Google isn't exactly starting from a weak spot.

1154
02:07:59,854 --> 02:08:11,648
今年 8 月，该公司宣布 Gemini 应用的月活跃用户已突破 10 亿，这让它与 ChatGPT 并驾齐驱，
因为 OpenAI 最近也表示其达到了 10 亿月活。
In August, the company announced the Gemini app had passed a billion monthly users, which puts it right alongside ChatGPT,
since OpenAI recently said it hit a billion monthly users too.

1155
02:08:12,014 --> 02:08:21,092
如果开发者最终发现 Argon 的实力确实如基准测试所示，那么 Alphabet 将完成一次巨大的追赶，
而此前很多人已经开始怀疑这家公司了。
If developers end up finding Argon as strong as these benchmarks say, Alphabet
pulls off a massive catch up for a company a lot of people had started to doubt.

1156
02:08:21,582 --> 02:08:23,972
如果你觉得 Google 真的强势回归了，请在评论区告诉我。
Let me know in the comments if you think Google's really back.

1157
02:08:24,414 --> 02:08:26,244
感谢观看，我们下期再见。
Thanks for watching and I'll catch you in the next one.

